1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,444
We spend our whole lives trying to be understood by strangers... forgetting that the quietest moments are often the most honest.

2
00:00:08,394 --> 00:00:11,306
You don't need an audience to heal.

3
00:00:11,306 --> 00:00:18,053
Sometimes, the most sacred room you'll ever enter... is the one inside your own peace.

